            *p to 40 ho*rs a week, so they can not even be c$onsidered as lazy. They
            play with other animals and they spend tim$e sleeping or lo*nging aro*nd.
            They enjoy long walks a$nd we all$ know cats will.>It is easy to bring
            a kitten home, b*t it is not so $easy to raise and raise a worthy member
